tosport에 관한 중요 정보 :\n\nGRID Autosport 를 플레이하려면 iOS 14 이상의 버전이 필요합니다. 게임과 무료 콘텐츠 팩을 전부 설치하려면 여유 공간 6GB가 필요합니다. 설치상의 문제를 피하기 위해 최소 8GB의 여유 공간을 확보하시길 권장합니다. \n\n지원되는 iPhone :\n • iPhone 6S / 6S Plus 이상\n • 모든 iPhone SE\n • iPod Touch (7세대 2019)\n\n지원되는 iPad :\n • iPad mini (5세대, 2019) 이상\n • iPad Air (3세대, 2019) 이상\n • iPad (5세대, 2017) 이상\n • 모든 iPad Pro\n\n• 도움이 필요하신 경우 고객지원팀(support@feralinteractive.com)으로 문의해 주십시오\n\n© 2014-2024 The Codemasters Software Company Limited (\"Codemasters\"). All rights reserved. \"Codemasters\"®, \"Ego\"®, the Codemasters logo and \"GRID\"® are registered trademarks owned by Codemasters. \"GRID Autosport\"™ and \"Codemasters Racing\"™ are trademarks of Codemasters. All other copyrights or trademarks are the property of their respective owners and are being used under license. Originally developed and published by Codemasters. Developed for and published on iOS by Feral Interactive Limited. iOS, iPhone and iPad are trademarks of Apple Inc., registered in the U.S. and other countries. Feral and the Feral logo are trademarks of Feral Interactive Ltd. All other trademarks and copyrights are the property of their respective owners. All rights reserved.", "minimumOsVersion": "14.0", "userRatingCount": 409}]}